+From 78a04a7536d68fa0d8e7dc2955d37aa7f592fca5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Arjan van de Ven <arjan@linux.intel.com>
+Date: Sun, 18 Feb 2018 23:35:41 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH 3/4] locking: rwsem: spin faster
